  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This CPO supports to strengthen institutional capacities and coordination of national employers&#x2019; organizations with respect to tripartite and bipartite social dialogue (i.e. collective bargaining, grievance handling and workplace cooperation) and delivery of core representation and service mandates.. The initiative aims to build the capacity of employers, especially in partnership with National Federation of Maldives Employers and Maldives Association of Tourism Industry. The CPO supports to build capacities of government as well as the social partners, to engage effectively in social dialogue and advocate for the progression of the Decent Work Agenda in the Maldives .</narrative>
  </description>
